cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If this software or its included measurements help your work, please cite
  the software and identify the exact evidence file you used.
title: "DGX Spark Dual-QSFP Suite: One ConnectX-7, Four Logical RoCE Devices"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "solidSF, Inc."
abstract: >-
  An independent topology-aware utility for validating and measuring two
  direct QSFP links between a pair of DGX Spark systems, where one ConnectX-7
  exposes four logical RoCE devices over two PCIe domains.
license: Apache-2.0
url: "https://github.com/solidsf-inc/dgx-spark-dual-qsfp"
repository-code: "https://github.com/solidsf-inc/dgx-spark-dual-qsfp"
keywords:
  - DGX Spark
  - ConnectX-7
  - RDMA
  - RoCE
  - QSFP
  - network benchmarking
